[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1444.31, "timestamp": "00:24:04", "text": "嗯，那里有一只棕色的猫。白色的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1456.59, "timestamp": "00:24:16", "text": "不均匀的。所以是三个，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1460.99, "timestamp": "00:24:20", "text": "Whitey、Kuro、Blackie，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1469.51, "timestamp": "00:24:29", "text": "恰特。嗯，我直播的时间不太寻常。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1471.669, "timestamp": "00:24:31", "text": "不，我其实想直播一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1472.88, "timestamp": "00:24:32", "text": "时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1474.43, "timestamp": "00:24:34", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1478.07, "timestamp": "00:24:38", "text": "实际上。不，不，我死了。我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1479.789, "timestamp": "00:24:39", "text": "逃脱，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1483.669, "timestamp": "00:24:43", "text": "哦，所以，是的，我的直播会像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1486.43, "timestamp": "00:24:46", "text": "这次。我正在尝试这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1489.19, "timestamp": "00:24:49", "text": "早晨。我正在尝试改变"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1492.549, "timestamp": "00:24:52", "text": "从现在开始，我每天早上都要到岗。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1496.07, "timestamp": "00:24:56", "text": "晚上能不能放松一下？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1498.19, "timestamp": "00:24:58", "text": "和"}]